### Criar médico
POST http://localhost:8080/api/medicos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Dr. Carlos Almeida",
  "cpf": "98765432100",
  "crm": "CRM-SP 123456",
  "especialidade": "Cardiologia",
  "telefone": "11988887777",
  "email": "carlos@medicenter.com"
}

### Listar médicos
GET http://localhost:8080/api/medicos

